%% Reprise - reproduction test loop
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as Engine
    participant B as Bob (bob run, agent mode, no execute)
    participant S as Sandbox (docker, no network)

    E->>B: write-repro-test prompt + fingerprint + report (untrusted block)
    B-->>E: writes test/reprise/issue-N.test.js<br/>returns JSON {test_file, signature, rationale}
    E->>E: check edit scope (only test/reprise/**), revert anything else
    loop attempt 1..3
        E->>S: run single test once
        S-->>E: JUnit result + output
        alt fails and output matches signature
            E->>E: accept test
        else passes, errors, or failure does not match
            E->>B: --resume task: revise-repro-test prompt + result details
            B-->>E: revised test + JSON
            E->>E: check edit scope again
        end
    end
    E->>E: accepted test goes to 20 trials, otherwise NEEDS_INFO
